{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_8", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_8.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Have you heard from the Mayor yet?", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Not yet.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "He is coming here later.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "I have given the matter a great deal of thought since last night.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Well?", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "From your point of view, as a doctor and a man of science, this affair of the water supply is an isolated matter.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "I mean, you do not realise that it involves a great many other things.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "How do you mean?\u2014Let us sit down, my dear fellow.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "No, sit here on the couch.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "(HOVSTAD Sits down on the couch, DR. STOCKMANN On a chair on the other side of the table.)", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Now then.", "para": 5, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "You mean that\u2014?", "para": 5, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "You said yesterday that the pollution of the water was due to impurities in the soil.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, unquestionably it is due to that poisonous morass up at Molledal.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Begging your pardon, Doctor, I fancy it is due to quite another morass altogether.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "What morass?", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "The morass that the whole life of our town is built on and is rotting in.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "What the deuce are you driving at, Hovstad?", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "The whole of the town's interests have, little by little, got into the hands of a pack of officials.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, come!\u2014they are not all officials.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "No, but those that are not officials are at any rate the officials' friends and adherents; it is the wealthy folk, the old families in the town, that have got us entirely in their hands.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, but after all they are men of ability and knowledge.", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "Did they show any ability or knowledge when they laid the conduit pipes where they are now?", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "No, of course that was a great piece of stupidity on their part.", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "But that is going to be set right now.", "para": 17, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you think that will be all such plain sailing?", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Plain sailing or no, it has got to be done, anyway.", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, provided the press takes up the question.", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "I don't think that will be necessary, my dear fellow, I am certain my brother\u2014", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Excuse me, doctor; I feel bound to tell you I am inclined to take the matter up.", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "In the paper?", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes.", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "When I took over the \"People's Messenger\" my idea was to break up this ring of self-opinionated old fossils who had got hold of all the influence.", "para": 24, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "But you know you told me yourself what the result had been; you nearly ruined your paper.", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, at the time we were obliged to climb down a peg or two, it is quite true\u2014because there was a danger of the whole project of the Baths coming to nothing if they failed us.", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "But now the scheme has been carried through, and we can dispense with these grand gentlemen.", "para": 26, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Dispense with them, yes; but, we owe them a great debt of gratitude.", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "That shall be recognised ungrudgingly, But a journalist of my democratic tendencies cannot let such an opportunity as this slip.", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "The bubble of official infallibility must be pricked.", "para": 28, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "This superstition must be destroyed, like any other.", "para": 28, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "I am whole-heartedly with you in that, Mr. Hovstad; if it is a superstition, away with it!", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "I should be very reluctant to bring the Mayor into it, because he is your brother.", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "But I am sure you will agree with me that truth should be the first consideration.", "para": 30, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "That goes without saying.", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "(With sudden emphasis.)", "para": 31, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, but\u2014but\u2014", "para": 31, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "You must not misjudge me.", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "I am neither more self-interested nor more ambitious than most men.", "para": 32, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "My dear fellow\u2014who suggests anything of the kind?", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "I am of humble origin, as you know; and that has given me opportunities of knowing what is the most crying need in the humbler ranks of life.", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "It is that they should be allowed some part in the direction of public affairs, Doctor.", "para": 34, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "That is what will develop their faculties and intelligence and self respect\u2014", "para": 34, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "I quite appreciate that.", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes\u2014and in my opinion a journalist incurs a heavy responsibility if he neglects a favourable opportunity of emancipating the masses\u2014the humble and oppressed.", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "I know well enough that in exalted circles I shall be called an agitator, and all that sort of thing; but they may call what they like.", "para": 36, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "If only my conscience doesn't reproach me, then\u2014", "para": 36, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "Quite right!", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "Quite right, Mr. Hovstad.", "para": 37, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "But all the same\u2014devil take it!", "para": 37, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "(A knock is heard at the door.)", "para": 37, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Come in!", "para": 37, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "(ASLAKSEN appears at the door.", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "He is poorly but decently dressed, in black, with a slightly crumpled white neckcloth; he wears gloves and has a felt hat in his hand.)", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen (bowing).", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "Excuse my taking the liberty, Doctor\u2014", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (getting up).", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah, it is you, Aslaksen!", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, Doctor.", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (standing up).", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "Is it me you want, Aslaksen?", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "No; I didn't know I should find you here.", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 112, "kind": "action", "text": "No, it was the Doctor I\u2014", "para": 43, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 113, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 114, "kind": "action", "text": "I am quite at your service.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 115, "kind": "action", "text": "What is it?", "para": 44, "sent": 2, "present": []}]}